  "description": "AI/RAG/cost operational dashboard (S13-16): chat and embedding provider latency (p95/p99) and errors by reason, token usage, estimated cost (USD/h), retrieval latency and hybrid-call vs chunks-returned, tool duration by outcome and ingestion failures — the AI/RAG family of the dedicated Prometheus (uid agentflow-prometheus). Provider errors are shown separately from application-side failures (tool outcomes, ingestion failures). Units labelled on every panel; no identifiers anywhere. Provisioned from Git; UI edits are refused.",
