  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "AI/RAG/cost operational dashboard (S13-16).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {},
      "mode": "markdown",
      "content": "# AI / RAG / Cost — operational (S13-16)\n\nEvery panel is a bounded `agentflow.*` meter over the dedicated Prometheus (`agentflow-prometheus`, the S13-05 store); no identifiers, no payloads, no prompts. **Provider errors (chat / embedding) are shown separately from application-side failures (tool outcomes, ingestion failures)** so a provider/API problem never hides behind an application validation problem. **Empty retrieval** shows up as a continuous hybrid-call rate with zero chunks returned — no series is invented to mark it. The scrape requires the S13-02 bearer token; while the app is down or the token expired, panels are honestly empty. Logs and traces are reachable via the links (top right)."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chat provider latency (p95 / p99, seconds)",
      "description": "Whole provider chat call (retry loop), one sample per call. A persistent p99 spike is a degraded provider.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "agentflow-prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "agentflow-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(agentflow_ai_provider_chat_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "agentflow-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(agentflow_ai_provider_chat_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
